    [Doc][Misc] Add anchor points for headings in kv_cache_pool_ascend_store (#19592)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    This PR adds explicit anchor points (`{: #... }`) to several headings in
    `kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md` and synchronizes these anchors in the
    Chinese translation file `kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.po`. This ensures
    that links to these specific sections function correctly and
    consistently across both English and Chinese versions of the
    documentation.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No, this is a documentation-only update.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    Verified that the anchor points match between the source markdown and
    the translated `.po` files.
    
